[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_9900","text":"少女"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0010","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_9901","text":"教师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0020","text":"升学意向是大学，对吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_9902","text":"少女"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0030","text":"并没有接受"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_9903","text":"少女"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0040","text":"虽然没接受，但已经认了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_9904","text":"少女"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0050","text":"一切都在改变"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_9905","text":"少女"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0060","text":"从高中生变成大学生，再变成社会人，\n总有一天连姓氏都会变吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_9906","text":"少女"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0070","text":"就好像，我在渐渐变成不是我的东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_9907","text":"少女"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0080","text":"但你不是说过吗，没有不变的东西\nnoctchill也是"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0090","text":"“人生没有永远”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_9908","text":"少女"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0100","text":"这是再普通不过的事────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_9909","text":"少女"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0110","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_9910","text":"少女"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0120","text":"播放量，涨了……！\n哇，是不是有人看到最后了────…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_9911","text":"少女"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0130","text":"……我干嘛为这种小事高兴啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_9912","text":"少女"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0140","text":"啊────────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0150","text":"──哎呀，又碰到施工中的路了\n因为是春天吗…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0160","text":"好亮啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0170","text":"嗯，啊\n可能因为还在施工吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0180","text":"抱歉，稍等一下\n我去问问怎么绕路"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0190","text":"OK——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_9913","text":"看板上的字"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_04_0200","text":"“正在修建新道路”"}]
